OL,3,AStingy bosses and spare change: How
OL,4,Amuch should you give to the office
OL,5,Awhip-round?
OL,6,
OL,7,FLove them, hate them or barely know
OL,8,Fthem, it's a colleague's birthday,
OL,9,Fwedding or leaving do and there's a
OL,10,Fcollection to mark the occasion.
OL,12,FSo how much should you give? And if
OL,13,Fyou're the person organising the
OL,14,Fcollection, how do you chase without
OL,15,Ffeeling like a loan shark or exposing
OL,16,Funspoken team dynamics?
OL,18,FThe politics of the office whip-round
OL,19,Fare so sensitive that everyone the BBC
OL,20,Fspoke to asked us not to use their real
OL,21,Fname.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
